01:04:36.271 --> 01:04:39.001
Enough to know your accent's
faker than my mom's soul.


01:04:39.174 --> 01:04:42.632
Oh, and don't get the dumb idea
to throw that Showcase.


01:04:42.811 --> 01:04:44.142
Because I talked to a lawyer.


01:04:44.312 --> 01:04:49.011
And he found a loophole that allows me
to access that money your daddy left you...


01:04:49.184 --> 01:04:51.744
...should I need it for a medical reason.


01:04:51.920 --> 01:04:54.787
<i>You know, hello, longer legs.</i>


01:04:54.956 --> 01:04:58.619
- Whoa, whoa, whoa. Before you go...
- I'll sing for Bev. Don't worry.


01:04:59.093 --> 01:05:01.118
Well, that was easier than I thought.


01:05:01.296 --> 01:05:03.161
Now, go and make me a vodka tonic.


01:05:03.331 --> 01:05:04.889
Hold the tonic.


01:05:14.609 --> 01:05:16.600
Her reign of terror's gotta stop.


01:05:16.778 --> 01:05:18.302
I'm in. What do we do?


01:05:18.480 --> 01:05:20.311
Look, there's nothing you can do.


01:05:20.982 --> 01:05:23.348
If you try to help,
it's just gonna make it worse.


01:05:23.518 --> 01:05:26.544
That woman is a demon
spawned from darkness itself.


01:05:26.721 --> 01:05:28.052
I wish she'd go straight back to...


01:05:28.223 --> 01:05:30.054
Hello, Ms. Gail.


01:05:30.225 --> 01:05:33.626
Have you, uh, released your mind
from the shackles of thinking today?


01:05:33.795 --> 01:05:35.695
- I'm working on it.
- Very good.


01:05:35.964 --> 01:05:38.694
- How was your meditation?
I hate you.


01:05:39.067 --> 01:05:41.331
Very good. You look pretty.


01:05:41.503 --> 01:05:43.198
I know.


01:05:44.873 --> 01:05:47.706
That broad
ain't getting away with ruining your life.


01:05:47.876 --> 01:05:49.537
I'm pooping in her bed tonight.


01:05:49.711 --> 01:05:52.544
Victor, I thought you hated me.


01:05:52.714 --> 01:05:53.806
Are you an idiot?


01:05:53.982 --> 01:05:56.143
You're the only person
who knows my birthday.


01:05:56.317 --> 01:05:58.182
The only one who says goodnight
to me.


01:05:58.353 --> 01:06:00.753
The only one who makes me
mac and cheese.


01:06:00.922 --> 01:06:03.117
You're annoying and ugly...


01:06:03.291 --> 01:06:04.690
...but I sort of love you.


01:06:07.128 --> 01:06:08.755
I sort of love you too.


01:06:09.364 --> 01:06:13.824
But just promise me
you're not gonna do anything, okay?


01:06:14.302 --> 01:06:15.894
- You too.
- Oh, come on.


01:06:16.070 --> 01:06:18.004
- Just... No... Ple...
- Just... No. Just...


01:06:18.172 --> 01:06:19.662
- No. Tony.
- Just one...


01:06:20.575 --> 01:06:21.906
Okay.


01:06:22.176 --> 01:06:26.579
All right.
Well, now I get to go fold Bev's delicates.


01:06:42.096 --> 01:06:45.725
- Have you heard of knocking?
- Ever heard of I don't care?


01:06:46.000 --> 01:06:48.161
Where'd you put my blue blouse?


01:06:48.336 --> 01:06:50.429
Oh, okay.


01:06:50.605 --> 01:06:53.130
Okay, which one of these
do you like better?


01:06:54.042 --> 01:06:57.944
- You actually want my opinion?
- God, I know. What's wrong with me?


01:06:58.913 --> 01:07:02.815
You know how you're a bitch and I act
like I don't care, but truth is I'm sensitive?


01:07:02.984 --> 01:07:05.509
- Actually...
- I need someone to talk to like a sister...


01:07:05.687 --> 01:07:07.587
...and you're better than nothing.


01:07:09.057 --> 01:07:13.494
I'm nervous about tonight.
Oh, my God, why did I just tell you that?


01:07:15.363 --> 01:07:17.456
I don't know.


01:07:17.799 --> 01:07:20.063
It's like my whole body is freaking out.


01:07:20.234 --> 01:07:21.326
I have hives on my butt.


01:07:21.502 --> 01:07:23.970
I can't tell Mom
and I can't talk to Luke about it.


01:07:24.138 --> 01:07:25.503
He'll say something like:


01:07:25.673 --> 01:07:28.608
"Oh, one minute
you're talented and we're connecting...


01:07:28.776 --> 01:07:32.007
...and the next minute you're self-involved
and histrionic."


01:07:32.180 --> 01:07:35.411
- What does that even mean? I hate history.
- He said that?


01:07:37.251 --> 01:07:41.119
Listen, Toadie, he's not falling for you,
he's falling for me.


01:07:41.289 --> 01:07:42.984
I just don't know who me is anymore.


01:07:43.157 --> 01:07:45.455
Why are you nervous?
You're not really singing.


01:07:45.627 --> 01:07:48.687
All you have to do is stand there
and look pretty.


01:07:50.264 --> 01:07:53.097
Have you ever thought
about how that makes me feel?


01:07:53.901 --> 01:07:55.368
You have talent.


01:07:55.536 --> 01:07:59.028
<i>You could go on American Idol
and forget about the rest of us.</i>


01:07:59.273 --> 01:08:01.605
This is, like, my only chance.


01:08:02.310 --> 01:08:04.039
Pretty doesn't last very long.


01:08:04.212 --> 01:08:06.146
Just look at Mom.


01:08:08.316 --> 01:08:09.442
You think I'm talented?


01:08:11.252 --> 01:08:13.345
If you tell anyone I said that, I'll deny it.


01:08:15.056 --> 01:08:16.580
Wear the blue blouse.


01:08:16.758 --> 01:08:18.726
It makes your eyes pop.


01:08:21.829 --> 01:08:23.057
This better work.


01:08:23.631 --> 01:08:25.861
Because if I go down,
you're go down with me.


01:08:38.846 --> 01:08:42.509
Yeah, yeah, yeah.
What's up, my party people?


01:08:42.684 --> 01:08:45.778
Yeah. All right, all right, all right.
Let's get this show started.


01:08:45.953 --> 01:08:49.946
Welcome to the stage, my boy, my British
biscuit and y'all's host for the night...


01:08:50.124 --> 01:08:52.615
...Luke Morgan.


01:08:55.196 --> 01:08:58.188
Are you amped for the Wellesley Academy
of the Arts Showcase?


01:08:59.734 --> 01:09:03.830
Good. Because we have Mickey O'Malley
spinning tonight.


01:09:07.775 --> 01:09:13.839
So let's get this party started
with Big Pain Ticket.


01:09:23.591 --> 01:09:27.357
<i>I wanna kiss your apocalypse</i>


01:09:27.528 --> 01:09:30.622
<i>Wrap you in my Armageddon</i>


01:09:30.798 --> 01:09:34.290
<i>Sing you a twisted serenade</i>


01:09:34.469 --> 01:09:37.529
<i>We can run away together</i>


01:09:47.715 --> 01:09:50.445
Hello, Guy. So glad you could make it.


01:09:50.618 --> 01:09:53.644
My two A&R guys, Tom and, uh, Tom.


01:09:54.222 --> 01:09:55.587
Uh, did I miss your big line up?


01:09:55.757 --> 01:09:59.352
You're just in time. And I know
you'll love the closing act. She's amazing.


01:09:59.527 --> 01:10:01.222
Well, I expect nothing less.


01:10:01.395 --> 01:10:06.628
Oh, yeah. Nothing and less are definitely
two words I'd use to describe it.


01:10:06.801 --> 01:10:09.429
Why don't I show you and the Toms
to the VIP section.


01:10:09.604 --> 01:10:13.131
Katie, go help Bev
with her makeup, please.


01:10:13.307 --> 01:10:14.968
- Okay.
- Now.


01:10:15.143 --> 01:10:17.168
This way, please, come on.


01:10:17.345 --> 01:10:19.404
What a lovely suit.


01:10:23.985 --> 01:10:25.077
Move it.


01:10:25.253 --> 01:10:27.653
Hey. Out of the way. Out of the way.
Michael, go on.


01:10:27.822 --> 01:10:30.086
