I'll see you at the end.


01:10:30.258 --> 01:10:32.123
Guy. Tom. Tom.


01:10:32.760 --> 01:10:34.159
I'll be right back.


01:10:36.697 --> 01:10:37.959
Good to see you.


01:10:38.132 --> 01:10:39.997
Nice suit.


01:10:46.841 --> 01:10:50.777
What was that back there?
This is your last chance to get it right.


01:10:50.945 --> 01:10:53.914
Unless you wanna see
Angela's Juilliard dreams go bye-bye.


01:10:54.081 --> 01:10:58.040
That what you wanna be? A little
dwarfish Asian girl's dream crusher, huh?


01:10:58.219 --> 01:10:59.243
- Do you?
- No. No.


01:10:59.420 --> 01:11:02.287
No? No? No? Then focus!


01:11:07.795 --> 01:11:10.457
- Look, Ange, you...
- Gail's been threatening me too.


01:11:10.631 --> 01:11:12.656
That's why you're doing
what she wants.


01:11:13.000 --> 01:11:15.298
