- Ange.


01:11:15.903 --> 01:11:17.837
You're my best friend.


01:11:18.005 --> 01:11:20.439
Look, I'd do anything for you.


01:11:30.918 --> 01:11:32.749
Okay.


01:11:34.989 --> 01:11:39.517
So we're gonna take it up a notch
with Jason Berkeley and the Funky Funk.


01:11:45.366 --> 01:11:46.390
Scratch that.


01:11:46.567 --> 01:11:49.502
Um, here are my boys, the Oral Majority.


01:11:58.212 --> 01:12:00.680
<i>I'm lost in a world that rattles my brain</i>


01:12:00.848 --> 01:12:04.750
<i>Cleaning up my life
From the mess you made, oh, oh</i>


01:12:07.555 --> 01:12:08.920
Move it. Guy.


01:12:09.090 --> 01:12:13.288
This is just the boring appetizer.
The real showstopper's up next.


01:12:13.461 --> 01:12:14.928
Ah!
Oh!


01:12:15.096 --> 01:12:17.963
You okay, Mr. Morgan?
Here, let me get that for you.


01:12:19.400 --> 01:12:20.594
Well, it had better be.


01:12:20.768 --> 01:12:21.996
I have to pee.


01:12:22.169 --> 01:12:25.400
Oh, I will take you to the pee, Mr. Victor.


01:12:28.342 --> 01:12:30.173
Sorry.


01:12:30.611 --> 01:12:33.136
<i>So keep on knocking, knocking, knocking</i>


01:12:33.314 --> 01:12:38.251
<i>But, baby, you're better off walking
'Cause I ain't gonna let you in</i>


01:12:38.986 --> 01:12:41.147
<i>Never again</i>


01:12:41.322 --> 01:12:44.382
<i>No, not again</i>


01:12:44.558 --> 01:12:46.924
<i>Never again</i>


01:12:47.094 --> 01:12:50.427
<i>No, not again</i>


01:12:55.236 --> 01:12:56.567
My brothers, yeah!


01:12:56.737 --> 01:12:58.136
Okay.


01:12:58.472 --> 01:13:00.633
You guys having a good time?


01:13:01.208 --> 01:13:05.611
Let's keep it going
with Beverly Van Ravensway.


01:13:17.725 --> 01:13:19.955
<i>Plug in the mike</i>


01:13:20.127 --> 01:13:21.424
<i>Open the curtain</i>


01:13:21.595 --> 01:13:22.960
<i>Turn on the lights</i>


01:13:23.764 --> 01:13:25.197
<i>I'm through rehearsing</i>


01:13:25.366 --> 01:13:27.459
<i>The feeling ignites</i>


01:13:27.635 --> 01:13:28.693
<i>I'm in control</i>


01:13:28.869 --> 01:13:32.965
<i>The crowd's in the palm of my hand
All my fans stand</i>


01:13:33.140 --> 01:13:36.576
<i>What is the truth?
What's an illusion?</i>


01:13:36.744 --> 01:13:40.441
<i>You're searching for proof
But are you certain?</i>


01:13:40.614 --> 01:13:44.175
<i>Whatever you see is what you get</i>


01:13:44.352 --> 01:13:48.152
<i>If words paint a picture
Then I bet you I can get you, yeah</i>


01:13:48.322 --> 01:13:52.554
<i>I'll make you believe in me</i>


01:13:52.727 --> 01:13:55.958
<i>I can be what you want me to be</i>


01:13:56.130 --> 01:13:59.566
<i>Tonight is the night
Where I'll make you see</i>


01:13:59.734 --> 01:14:03.431
<i>That I can be
Anything, anything, anything</i>


01:14:03.604 --> 01:14:08.007
<i>I'll make you believe in me</i>


01:14:08.175 --> 01:14:09.642
<i>I can be what you want...</i>


01:14:13.514 --> 01:14:14.538
Give me...


01:14:21.222 --> 01:14:25.318
I'm so sorry, my mike...
My mike isn't working.


01:14:25.726 --> 01:14:28.217
Uh, excuse me.


01:14:31.098 --> 01:14:33.225
<i>I don't know.
- Give me that. Give me that.</i>


01:14:38.439 --> 01:14:42.671
How dare you sabotage your mother,
you rotten, rotten little boy?


01:14:42.843 --> 01:14:45.403
You, give me that. It doesn't matter.


01:14:45.579 --> 01:14:48.275
- We'll do it live.
- What? What?


01:14:49.650 --> 01:14:51.584
Ha. My mike is broken. I'm so sorry.


01:14:56.524 --> 01:14:57.650
Here.


01:14:59.026 --> 01:15:00.357
