01:15:00.528 --> 01:15:02.155
Stay.


01:15:06.634 --> 01:15:08.431
No, no, no. You gotta get out of here.


01:15:08.836 --> 01:15:12.135
You're about to sing for Bev.
Why are you about to sing for Bev?


01:15:13.074 --> 01:15:14.098
She can't sing.


01:15:20.548 --> 01:15:21.810
Come on.


01:15:21.982 --> 01:15:23.882
Hey. All of you, keep playing.


01:15:24.552 --> 01:15:26.349
Keep playing, you idiots.


01:15:26.520 --> 01:15:28.818
It was your voice the whole time?
Bev never sang at all?


01:15:30.424 --> 01:15:33.791
And she's about to not sing
for a whole bunch of people, so please...


01:15:33.961 --> 01:15:37.158
And on the dates, that... That was you.


01:15:41.602 --> 01:15:43.729
<i>I got nothing to lose</i>


01:15:44.238 --> 01:15:45.603
<i>I've been exposed</i>


01:15:45.773 --> 01:15:47.900
<i>I'm paying my dues</i>


01:15:48.075 --> 01:15:49.235
<i>Playing the role</i>


01:15:49.410 --> 01:15:51.776
<i>I'm breaking the rules</i>


01:15:51.946 --> 01:15:53.140
<i>Flow in the flow</i>


01:15:53.314 --> 01:15:57.273
<i>I got the whole world nodding, yes
Like some bobbleheads</i>


01:15:57.451 --> 01:15:58.816
<i>I'll break a sweat</i>


01:16:00.020 --> 01:16:01.044
<i>If you want it</i>


01:16:01.222 --> 01:16:03.349
<i>Confess all your sins</i>


01:16:03.524 --> 01:16:04.821
<i>You know you got 'em</i>


01:16:04.992 --> 01:16:07.256
<i>The room's in a spin</i>


01:16:07.428 --> 01:16:08.452
<i>The fever's pitched</i>


01:16:08.629 --> 01:16:10.597
- You gotta go. Come on, get out there.
Aah!


01:16:10.764 --> 01:16:12.561
<i>I'm legit, I'm no counterfeit</i>


01:16:12.733 --> 01:16:17.193
<i>I'll make you believe in me</i>


01:16:17.371 --> 01:16:20.135
<i>I can be what you want me to be</i>


01:16:20.307 --> 01:16:23.970
<i>Tonight is the night where I make you see</i>


01:16:24.145 --> 01:16:27.774
<i>That I can be
Anything, anything, anything</i>


01:16:27.948 --> 01:16:32.351
<i>I'll make you believe in me</i>


01:16:32.520 --> 01:16:33.714
<i>I can be what you want me to be</i>


01:16:33.888 --> 01:16:36.686
Hey! Shut that camera down! Now!


01:16:36.857 --> 01:16:39.325
<i>Tonight is the night where I make you see</i>


01:16:39.493 --> 01:16:43.395
<i>That I can be
Anything, anything, anything</i>


01:16:43.564 --> 01:16:45.657
<i>You want from me</i>


01:16:52.106 --> 01:16:53.903
That's what I'm talking about.


01:16:55.743 --> 01:16:58.234
Shut the power down. Shut it down.


01:17:01.382 --> 01:17:03.782
Not so fast, jerknuts.


01:17:07.087 --> 01:17:08.452
Hey. Clear.


01:17:11.559 --> 01:17:13.959
<i>Sing something else.
We want more! We want more!</i>


01:17:14.128 --> 01:17:15.425
Like what?


01:17:15.696 --> 01:17:17.561
The demo you snuck my dad. I heard it.


01:17:17.731 --> 01:17:19.528
Yeah, do it!
Do it!


01:17:19.700 --> 01:17:25.070
<i>We want more!
We want more! We want more!</i>


01:17:27.841 --> 01:17:29.809
Okay, follow my lead, guys.


01:17:37.518 --> 01:17:41.511
<i>There's a little secret
I would like to tell you</i>


01:17:44.625 --> 01:17:49.255
<i>There's a book of lies
I know they'll try to sell you</i>


01:17:50.497 --> 01:17:54.058
<i>And they'll try and they'll try
To convince you to buy</i>


01:17:54.235 --> 01:17:55.725
<i>You need them</i>


01:17:57.705 --> 01:18:01.141
<i>So the next time you're down
Look inside, not around</i>


01:18:01.308 --> 01:18:04.471
<i>I can dress myself</i>


01:18:04.645 --> 01:18:07.580
<i>There's no need for someone's help</i>


01:18:07.748 --> 01:18:09.375
<i>There's no one to blame</i>


01:18:09.550 --> 01:18:15.284
<i>There's no one to save you but yourself</i>


01:18:15.456 --> 01:18:18.755
<i>I can justify</i>


01:18:18.926 --> 01:18:21.895
<i>All the mistakes in my life</i>


01:18:22.062 --> 01:18:25.259
<i>It's taught me to be
It's given to me</i>


01:18:25.432 --> 01:18:27.832
<i>And I'll survive</i>


01:18:28.002 --> 01:18:31.130
<i>'Cause I have blessed myself</i>


01:18:32.606 --> 01:18:39.478
<i>Do you ever wonder
How anything can make you cry?</i>


01:18:39.647 --> 01:18:43.310
<i>Have yourself discover</i>


01:18:43.484 --> 01:18:50.481
<i>That the pain you feel
Is the pain that you deny</i>


01:18:50.658 --> 01:18:53.923
<i>You can bless yourself</i>


01:18:54.094 --> 01:18:56.995
<i>There's no need for someone else</i>


01:18:57.164 --> 01:19:04.593
<i>There's no one to blame
There's no one to save you but yourself</i>


01:19:04.772 --> 01:19:07.969
<i>I can justify</i>


01:19:08.142 --> 01:19:11.111
<i>All the mistakes in my life</i>


01:19:11.278 --> 01:19:14.372
<i>It's taught me to be
It's given to me</i>


01:19:14.548 --> 01:19:17.039
<i>And I'll survive</i>


01:19:17.217 --> 01:19:19.947
<i>'Cause I have blessed myself</i>


01:19:37.471 --> 01:19:39.132
Thank you, ladies and gentlemen.


01:19:39.306 --> 01:19:42.707
We hope you enjoyed the Wellesley
Academy of Arts Showcase.


01:19:42.876 --> 01:19:45.436
Oh, my God, you were so good.


01:19:45.813 --> 01:19:48.145
Who are you?
You're like a freaking rock star.


01:19:48.315 --> 01:19:50.408
Are you kidding me? Man, she likes you...


01:20:01.628 --> 01:20:04.563
So, what did he say? Is he mad?


01:20:04.732 --> 01:20:06.393
Yeah. He's pretty ticked off...


01:20:06.567 --> 01:20:10.333
...that I'm not already making
the next big album for Kensington Records.


01:20:12.306 --> 01:20:14.069
Oh. Which album?


01:20:14.975 --> 01:20:15.999
Your album.


01:20:17.678 --> 01:20:19.669
- Are you kidding me?
- No.


01:20:21.281 --> 01:20:23.749
- You're... You're serious?
- Uh-huh.


01:20:25.986 --> 01:20:27.317
Go for it.


01:20:27.488 --> 01:20:30.252
We're making an album.
And we're writing it together.


01:20:30.424 --> 01:20:32.483
Yeah! Yeah!
I'm so happy.


01:20:32.659 --> 01:20:34.456
You know, I sing too.


01:20:34.628 --> 01:20:38.257
I can do a whole monologue album.
Incredible. Hey, congratulations.


01:20:38.432 --> 01:20:42.960
- Yo, blow it up. Boom.
I'm your boy. Call me up.


01:20:43.137 --> 01:20:46.538
Yeah. Yeah, he's really good
at guitars. He's a kook.


01:21:01.255 --> 01:21:02.847
Guy! Wait!


01:21:03.023 --> 01:21:06.515
- What now, Gail? More lies?
- Well, everyone lies in this business.


01:21:06.693 --> 01:21:07.717
It's called spin.


01:21:08.362 --> 01:21:09.727
So Bev can't sing.


01:21:09.897 --> 01:21:11.626
That didn't stop Jessica Simpson.


01:21:11.799 --> 01:21:15.394
Well, we'll see what the school board
thinks when I get them a ring, shall we?


01:21:15.769 --> 01:21:18.567
