01:21:22.876 --> 01:21:24.343
Guy!


01:21:25.679 --> 01:21:29.342
I will have my nirvana moment.


01:21:29.583 --> 01:21:33.349
<i>I'll make you believe in me</i>


01:21:34.822 --> 01:21:37.882
<i>I can be what you want me to be</i>


01:21:38.058 --> 01:21:40.652
Oh, come on. Look alive, people.
I'm a star.


01:21:40.828 --> 01:21:42.386
Let's try this again.


01:21:42.596 --> 01:21:44.461
<i>I'll make you believe...</i>


01:21:46.033 --> 01:21:48.763
Oh, no. You want a piece of me?


01:22:14.428 --> 01:22:16.658
Hey. Clear.


01:22:32.346 --> 01:22:34.507
<i>Run this town tonight</i>


01:22:34.681 --> 01:22:37.047
Where's breakfast...? Sorry.


01:23:18.926 --> 01:23:21.520
<i>I'm lost in a world
That rattles my brain</i>


01:23:21.695 --> 01:23:24.562
<i>I'm cleaning up my life
From the mess you made, oh, oh</i>


01:23:29.536 --> 01:23:33.063
- Katie, are you wearing a doormat?
- Welcome.


01:23:39.513 --> 01:23:41.572
Thanks. Now the pants.


01:23:46.753 --> 01:23:51.053
And then it would just take you somewhere
that you never expected you would go.


01:23:55.495 --> 01:23:58.487
<i>You wanna hear
the monologue from My Fair Lady?</i>


01:23:58.665 --> 01:24:00.792
Oy, mate, oy.


01:24:20.287 --> 01:24:22.152
I love my life.


01:24:22.322 --> 01:24:24.517
<i>Call me.
- Hello?</i>


01:24:46.980 --> 01:24:50.177
<i>Yeah. You like it? You like it? Yeah.</i>

